msgid "Desktop Client"
msgstr "Cliente para desktop"

#: ../../desktop/index.rst:5
msgid ""
"The Nextcloud desktop client for Windows, macOS, and Linux keeps files "
"synchronized between your computer and your Nextcloud server."
msgstr ""
"O cliente para desktop do Nextcloud para Windows, macOS e Linux mantém os "
"arquivos sincronizados entre o seu computador e o servidor Nextcloud."

